{"ref":"BDB, גּוּפָה","hw":"גּוּפָה","html":"† <big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">גּוּפָה</span>]</big>  <strong>n.f. body, corpse (</strong>late; NH <span dir=\"rtl\">גּוּף</span>, Aramaic <span dir=\"rtl\">גּוּפָא</span>; Arabic <span dir=\"rtl\">جِيفَةٌ</span> <strong>)</strong>—cstr. sg. <span dir=\"rtl\">גּוּפַת</span> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 10:12\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.10.12\">1 Ch 10:12</a>; cstr. pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">גּוּפֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 10:12\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.10.12\">1 Ch 10:12</a>, cf. Be (‖ <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 31:12\" href=\"/I_Samuel.31.12\">1 S 31:12</a> has <span dir=\"rtl\">גְּוִיָּה</span>).","next":"BDB, גּוּר","prev":"BDB, גּוּף"}